## Swagger controller → project files (same base name)

For each **controller** in Swagger, use one matching **snake_case** base name (e.g. `Authentication` → `authentication`):

| Layer | Path | Example |
|-------|------|---------|
| Retrofit client | `lib/data/services/clients/<name>_client.dart` | `authentication_client.dart` |
| Repository | `lib/data/repositories/<name>_repository.dart` | `authentication_repository.dart` |
| Riverpod providers | `lib/data/providers/<name>_provider.dart` | `authentication_provider.dart` |

- **Do not** add separate provider files per page or UI step (no `phone_login_ui_provider.dart`-style splits). Put related notifiers in the same domain `*_provider.dart` (multiple `@riverpod` classes in one file is OK).
- Providers call **repositories only**, not Retrofit clients directly.
- Repositories call **clients** in `lib/data/services/clients/` only.
- Shared Retrofit helpers (Dio module, interceptors, converters, `FutureApiResponse` typedefs) may stay under `lib/data/services/` as infrastructure—not a substitute for `lib/data/services/clients/<controller>_client.dart`.
